                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Hello, I read in the newspaper that there is a French movie showing here at the cinema this month. I’d like two tickets please.\\nB: Yes, you’re right about the French film showing here, but unfortunately it doesn’t start until next Thursday. I’m sorry about that. But while you’re here, you can buy a pair of tickets in advance if you want.\\nA: Actually, I think we’ll just come back on the opening night. Thanks anyway.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
